Scripts to generate the sparse data module for exponential minimax approximations
of 1/x as a sum over exponential functions.

The source data are tabulated coefficients from
D. Braess and W. Hackbusch, IMA Journal of Numerical Analysis 25.4 (2005): 685-697
http://www.mis.mpg.de/scicomp/EXP_SUM/1_x

Usage:
first execute
./wget_minimax.sh
to download the data and then execute
./minimax_to_fortran_source.py
to create (overwrite) src/minimax/minimax_exp_data.F.

The generator adaptively selects interpolation knots and performs a dense numerical
certification against the tabulated minimax-error envelope before writing the source.
It formats the generated Fortran source with CP2K's precommit formatter before writing
it or checking it with `--check`.
